tools:
WebMCP tools available in this document:
[
  {
    "name": "search_neighborhood_projects",
    "description": "Find current neighbourhood projects by area, interest, or available time, and show the search in the shared interface.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "max_hours": {
          "maximum": 8,
          "minimum": 1,
          "type": "number"
        },
        "query": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "origin": "https://patchwork-webmcp.pages.dev",
    "pageUrl": "https://patchwork-webmcp.pages.dev/"
  },
  {
    "name": "build_action_plan",
    "description": "Create a realistic action plan from selected neighbourhood projects, display it for human review, and save it on this device.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "project_ids": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "maxItems": 8,
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "project_ids"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "origin": "https://patchwork-webmcp.pages.dev",
    "pageUrl": "https://patchwork-webmcp.pages.dev/"
  },
  {
    "name": "propose_neighborhood_project",
    "description": "Structure a community need as a project draft and display it for explicit human approval before it can join the neighbourhood catalog.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "area": {
          "maxLength": 80,
          "minLength": 2,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": {
          "maxLength": 300,
          "minLength": 10,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "hours": {
          "maximum": 8,
          "minimum": 1,
          "type": "number"
        },
        "title": {
          "maxLength": 100,
          "minLength": 3,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "enum": [
            "Outdoors",
            "Skills",
            "Food",
            "Community"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "title",
        "area",
        "type",
        "hours",
        "description"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "origin": "https://patchwork-webmcp.pages.dev",
    "pageUrl": "https://patchwork-webmcp.pages.dev/"
  },
  {
    "name": "pledge_support",
    "description": "Draft a support pledge and show it for human review. Never submit or commit without explicit human confirmation.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "contribution": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "project_id": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "project_id",
        "contribution"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "origin": "https://patchwork-webmcp.pages.dev",
    "pageUrl": "https://patchwork-webmcp.pages.dev/"
  }
]
Call tools.call(name, input) to invoke one.
